save(313,dict(paragraphs=["Mrinmoy Kumar Nath combines poetry with a professional background in dentistry in Assam. His journal biography places him in Mangaldoi and describes work as a lyricist as well as a poet. Reports of literary gatherings also connect his name with Assam’s wider poetry and cultural community.","His two Kabita Live contributions approach departure on different scales. ‘If I go away’ moves from reproach towards the shared memory left by a relationship. ‘If I die’ asks whether a death in the service of one’s country awakens courage or leaves only fear. Their direct language and conditional openings turn absence into a question addressed to those who remain."],sources=[source('The Assam Post: Pragya Mail poetry conference preview, 24 October 2025','https://centralread.com/media/2025/10/24/The_Assam_Post_24_Oct.pdf',['Page 5 organizer press-conference report identifies Dr Mrinmoy Nath as Assam poet and dentist.']),source('Dainandin Barta: Asom Sahitya Sabha foundation-day gathering','https://www.dainandinbartagroup.in/asom-sahitya-sabha-bajali-109/',['Assamese full name Dr Mrinmoy Kumar Nath in literary association gathering; cultural-subcommittee role, not overall Sabha presidency.'])],identity_match='Dentist and Assam poet in conference reporting align with captured professional identity; Assamese full-name reporting corroborates literary association. Unrelated railway/secretariat and student namesakes excluded.',poems_read=[dict(id=438,title='If I go away',basis='Full English text: conditional departure, responsibility, uncertainty of arrival/leaving and sweet memory.'),dict(id=374,title='If I die',basis='Full English text: conditional patriotic sacrifice, courage contrasted with self-consuming anger and fear.')],limitations=['Captured three book titles not independently verified or linked. Government seniority and current appointment not newly asserted. English newspaper describes overall Sabha leadership while Assamese reporting specifies cultural subcommittee; precise office omitted. Festival announcement not treated as proof of attendance. No political affiliations inferred from poetic speaker.'],next_action='Verify books and preferred transliterations with author/editor; independent factual review.'))
